      "message": "[warning] Line 50: 🟡 Splitting with `content.range(of: name)` is fragile because it truncates the first textual match, not necessarily the actual inserted display-name token. If the same substring appears in surrounding localized text (or multiple times), truncation can target the wrong segment and hide action text again. Prefer deriving segments from a format/template placeholder (or returning structured parts from `getContactInteractionString`) instead of searching the rendered string.",
